        <li><strong>Hanfu Story</strong> ($60--$250): Best mid-range option with consistent quality and international shipping. Their Tang collection includes complete ruqun + daxiu shan sets with good color accuracy. Ships to US, UK, EU, and Australia.</li>
        <li><strong>Nuwa Hanfu</strong> ($300--$2,000+): Premium custom-made Tang sets with genuine silk and hand-embroidery. Specializes in Tang bridal and formalwear. Expect 4--8 week production time for custom orders.</li>
        <li><strong>Taobao -- Shisanyu</strong> ($80--$400): One of the most popular Hanfu brands in China, known for beautiful Tang-style designs with vibrant color options and modernized silhouettes. Use a Taobao agent like Superbuy for international shipping.</li>
        <li><strong>Taobao -- Huajianji</strong> ($50--$200): Excellent mid-range Tang ruqun with good fabric quality and accurate historical details. Their cotton-silk blends are particularly comfortable for all-day wear at festivals.</li>
        <li><strong>NewMoonDance</strong> ($40--$180): Budget-friendly entry point with surprisingly good quality for the price. Best for your first Tang set before investing in premium pieces. Ships internationally from their Etsy store.</li>
      </ul>

